                "content": "## Landscape Overview (10 systems):\n- **corp.itsm**: ITSM system with agents for incident management, root cause analysis, change coordination, safety incidents, and asset provisioning (NO retrieval APIs)\n- **sap.crm**: CRM system with agents for opportunity management, sales coordination, and campaign optimization\n- **sap.s4**: ERP system with procurement, BOM, sales, and change orchestration agents; sales order management with OpportunityToOrderAutomationEngine\n- **sap.sf**: HR/HCM system (SuccessFactors) with EmployeeCompensationManagement API and compensation automation agents\n- **sap.ariba**: Procurement system with PurchaseOrderNetworkAPI (supplier POs), SourceingCampaignAndAccountManagementAPI, invoice matching, sourcing, compliance APIs\n- **sap.ehs**: Safety/compliance system with risk identification, incident analysis, and compliance automation agents\n- **workday.hcm**: HCM system with compensation adjustment/change processors\n- **siemens.plm**: PLM system with BOM compliance and engineering change agents\n- **my.mes**: MES system with production quality and change orchestration agents\n- **sap.odm, emarsys.cx**: Other domain systems\n\n## KEY FINDING - Customer Order Management:\n**Activity: Pull customer purchases and modify orders before shipment**\n- sap.s4 (ERP) has OpportunityToOrderAutomationEngine agent for order lifecycle\n- sap.s4 is the system responsible for sales order management (customer orders)\n- sap.ariba PurchaseOrderNetworkAPI is for SUPPLIER POs (inbound procurement), not customer sales orders\n- Best resource: sap.s4 for complete sales order/customer purchase management\n"
